# Paper Formatter — Client Environment Variables
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL: Backend API base URL (without /api/v1)
#   - Local dev with Vite proxy: leave empty (default: '')
#   - Production (Vercel): set to Railway/Fly backend URL
#
# Examples:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://paper-formatter-api.up.railway.app
